(1. The Problem Statement) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
45. 673.8899999999999864 Td
(Retail investors face severe information asymmetry when evaluating equities. While quarterly reports, 10-Ks, and earnings statements) Tj
T* (contain the vital truth about a company's financial health, they are deliberately dense, jargon-laden, and multi-faceted. Retail investors) Tj
T* (typically lack either the formal accounting expertise or the 3-5 hours required per company to calculate operating leverage, inspect) Tj
T* (cash-flow conversion, or audit balance sheet debt maturity.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Consequently, retail investors bifurcate into two losing behaviors: \(1\) they outsource conviction to speculative social media tips and) Tj
T* (unverified star ratings, or \(2\) they drown in tabular financial screeners that present raw data without translating numbers into) Tj
T* (operational reality \(e.g. failing to notice margin compression or cash conversion divergence\). The core problem is not a shortage of) Tj
T* (financial data, but a shortage of grounded, interpretable synthesis.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
45. 571.3899999999999864 Td
(2. Why Nubra Should Solve It) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
45. 560.3899999999999864 Td
(Nubra's mission centers on building transparent, user-aligned modern financial infrastructure. Today, retail trading apps monetize churn) Tj
T* (and high-frequency speculative activity, leading to customer attrition. By offering Fundamentals Copilot, Nubra solves a critical strategic) Tj
T* (wedge:) Tj
T* (• Trust & Retention: Empowering users to build genuine investment conviction increases customer lifetime value \(LTV\) and asset) Tj
T* (retention over speculative churn.) Tj
T* (• Defensible Differentiation: Competitors offer raw tables \(unusable for casual investors\) or generic generative AI chat \(prone to) Tj
T* (hallucinations and arithmetic errors\). Nubra establishes authority by offering deterministic, auditable financial synthesis.) Tj
T* (• Platform Expansion: Serves as the research anchor of the Nubra ecosystem, bridging retail discovery with informed long-term) Tj
T* (investing.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
45. 457.8899999999999864 Td
(3. The Solution Space) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
45. 446.8899999999999864 Td
(We evaluated three potential product directions:) Tj
T* (• Option A: Conversational Free-Form LLM Chatbot. Rejected due to financial hallucination risks, inability to audit arithmetic, and the) Tj
T* (cognitive burden placed on users to formulate prompt queries.) Tj
T* (• Option B: Traditional Ratio Screener \(P/E, ROE\). Rejected because static metrics fail to explain why numbers changed or distinguish) Tj
T* (operational facts from external headwinds.) Tj
T* (• Option C: Deterministic, Evidence-Linked Research Copilot \(Selected\). Ingests multi-period financial statements, calculates) Tj
T* (mathematical metrics deterministically, and synthesizes structured briefs where every insight is tagged as a Measured Fact or) Tj
T* (Hypothesis with full formula provenance.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
45. 354.8899999999999864 Td
(4. Scope Boundaries) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
45. 343.8899999999999864 Td
(What is in Scope:) Tj
T* (• Deterministic Metric Engine: Pure mathematical calculation of YoY growth, margins, FCF \(OCF - Capex\), FCF conversion, and Net) Tj
T* (Debt across 3-5 periods.) Tj
T* (• Evidence Provenance: Every insight cites its supporting metric, evaluated periods, start/ending values, and exact calculation formula.) Tj
T* (• Categorized Brief: Positive Signals, Risks/Deteriorations, Strategic Opportunities, Missing Disclosures, and Suggested Management) Tj
T* (Questions.) Tj
T* (• Export & Usability: Instant Markdown copy, publication-grade multi-page PDF generation, JSON audit export, and validated CSV) Tj
T* (upload.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (What is out of Scope:) Tj
T* (• Automated trading, brokerage order routing, speculative price targets, or unsupported buy/sell/hold ratings.) Tj
T* (• Real-time ticker streaming APIs \(prioritizing deterministic depth over live market latency\).) Tj
