(1. Open Dashboard: Inspect clean institutional interface and pre-loaded demonstration data labeling.) Tj
T* (2. Switch Archetypes: Toggle between APEX \(SaaS\), NPM \(MedTech\), VANG \(Debt/Logistics\), and BGT \(Biotech burn\).) Tj
T* (3. Filter Periods: Toggle between "All 5Y" and "Last 3Y" and review interactive Recharts visualizations.) Tj
T* (4. Inspect Formulas: Click the "Info" icon on any KPI card to view the exact algebraic formula and source inputs.) Tj
T* (5. Generate Brief: Click "Generate Research Brief" and observe the 4-step synthesis pipeline.) Tj
T* (6. Audit Evidence: Click "Inspect Evidence" on any positive signal or risk to view the full arithmetic audit trail.) Tj
T* (7. Download PDF: Click "Download PDF" in the header to export the complete multi-page research brief.) Tj
